  description: "Activate 1 of these effects (but you can only use each effect of
    \"Solfachord Happiness\" once per turn);\r\n\u25CF Discard 1 card, and if you
    do, add 2 \"Solfachord\" Pendulum Monsters with different Scales from your Deck
    to your hand, then you can Special Summon \"Solfachord\" Pendulum Monsters from
    your hand, up to the number of monsters your opponent controls +1.\r\n\u25CF
    During your Main Phase this turn, you can conduct 1 Pendulum Summon of a \"Solfachord\"
    monster(s) in addition to your Pendulum Summon (you can only gain this effect
    once per turn).\r\n\u25CF Special Summon 2 \"Solfachord\" cards from your Pendulum
    Zones."
